msgid "### 5.1 CPU-only Build Verification {: #cpu-only-build-verification }"
msgstr "### 5.1 CPU-only build verification {: #cpu-only-build-verification }"

msgid ""
"CPU-only build verification checks only the Python/package build. It does "
"not verify:"
msgstr "CPU-only build 只验证 Python/package 构建，不验证："

msgid ""
"- the NPU runtime;\n"
"- custom kernels;\n"
"- NPU inference;\n"
"- NPU-specific tests."
msgstr ""
"- NPU runtime；\n"
"- custom kernel；\n"
"- NPU inference；\n"
"- NPU-specific tests。"

msgid ""
"Even without an NPU, the build stage generally still requires matching CANN "
"Toolkit headers and libraries."
msgstr "即使没有 NPU，构建阶段通常仍需要匹配的 CANN Toolkit headers 和 libraries。"

msgid "Install the build dependencies:"
msgstr "安装构建依赖："

msgid "After installing the matching dependencies, run:"
msgstr "安装匹配依赖后："

msgid "Set `SOC_VERSION` for the target hardware."
msgstr "根据目标硬件设置 `SOC_VERSION`。"

msgid "For example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Then run:"
msgstr "然后执行："

msgid ""
"Passing CPU-only verification does not mean that the runtime environment is ready.\n"
"    Before release or runtime use, you must still complete the installation verification and Quickstart inference on the corresponding NPU."
msgstr ""
"CPU-only verification 通过，不代表运行时环境可用。\n"
"    真正发布或运行前，仍需要在对应 NPU 上完成 Installation verification 和\n"
"    Quickstart inference。"
